hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1735","**\nNarrated to us Muhammad ibn Bashshar, narrated to us Muhammad ibn Ja'far, narrated to us Shu'bah, from Muhammad ibn Ziyad, who said: I heard Abu Hurayrah (RA) say that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said:\n\n\Indeed"","" there is an hour on Friday in which no Muslim servant encounters it while asking Allah for good except that He grants it to him.\"""""""
